at least \code{min_labels} distinct observed values (e.g. a 1-10 scale with
labelled end points only) or no value labels at all. Factors, character
vectors and labelled variables with fewer values are summarized as
\emph{categorical} (frequency distributions). Use \code{treat_as = "numeric"} or
\code{"categorical"} to treat all variables the same way.
